<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7055] Text query for a particular field not working</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7055</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Lucene queries allow to specify a specific field name to search in &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;, however this doesn&apos;t seem to work in latest versions of Ignite.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To reproduce, modify &lt;tt&gt;CacheQueryExample#textQuery&lt;/tt&gt; to use Lucene field expression:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
QueryCursor&amp;lt;Cache.Entry&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Long&lt;/span&gt;, Person&amp;gt;&amp;gt; masters =
    cache.query(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; TextQuery&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Long&lt;/span&gt;, Person&amp;gt;(Person.class, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;resume:Master&quot;&lt;/span&gt;));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This query returns empty result.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://lucene.apache.org/core/5_5_2/queryparser/org/apache/lucene/queryparser/classic/package-summary.html#Fields&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://lucene.apache.org/core/5_5_2/queryparser/org/apache/lucene/queryparser/classic/package-summary.html#Fields&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13121481">IGNITE-7055</key>
            <summary>Text query for a particular field not working</summary>
